title: 'cumulus: retain resubmission proofs for catch-up imports'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Store resubmission proofs for unfinalized blocks imported during catch-up, so a collator
    that only imported a sealed segment can resubmit it when the original author is offline.
    Forwarding holds at most one proof and waits for a missing relay header.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: patch
